@model dynamic

<h3>Settings</h3>
<p style="color: #94a3b8;">Read-only for this sample — there is nothing to submit here. These are the values <code>AddVaxel</code> and the CSP middleware are using. The live rail uses one SSE connection on <code>&lt;body vx-sse&gt;</code>.</p>
<div style="margin-top: 1rem;">
    <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Heartbeat interval: <strong>20s</strong></label>
    <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Connection cap: <strong>4 per identity</strong></label>
    <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">CSP: <strong>script-src 'self'</strong> (no unsafe-eval)</label>
    <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Stream URL: <strong>/_vaxel/stream</strong></label>
</div>
